---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Renegade Capital | The Activist's Podcast for Finance & Investments"
  description="When we ask the big questions, we get real answers. Blending social justice investing with the frontiers of AI."
>
  <main class="flex flex-1 flex-col">
    <section class="relative flex min-h-[85svh] flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-background px-6 py-24 text-center">
      <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
        <div class="h-[600px] w-[600px] rounded-full bg-[#a96c61]/10 blur-3xl"></div>
        <div class="absolute h-[400px] w-[400px] rounded-full bg-[#bac48c]/10 blur-3xl translate-x-1/3 translate-y-1/3"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <span class="mb-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#a96c61]/30 bg-[#a96c61]/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-[#a96c61] uppercase">
          <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#a96c61] animate-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          The Next Evolution
        </span>

        <img
          src="https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/682230d9918bf67071aafaab/2a4bdae2-a3d2-4268-88ca-05bada9d11ae/RC_Logo+transparent+%281%29.png"
          alt="Renegade Capital"
          class="mx-auto w-full max-w-2xl dark:invert opacity-95 mb-10 drop-shadow-sm"
        />

        <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">
          the activist's podcast <br className="hidden sm:block" />
          <span class="text-muted-foreground font-light italic text-2xl sm:text-3xl">for finance & investments</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mx-auto mt-8 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">
          When we ask the big questions, something unexpected happens: <strong class="text-foreground font-semibold">We get real answers.</strong>
          Now, we are expanding our mission, blending our roots in social activist investing with the frontier of Artificial Intelligence to unlock new audiences and interactive experiences.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
          <a href="/episodes" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#a96c61] px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow transition-colors hover:bg-[#8b574d] focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-[#a96c61]">
            Explore AI Matchups
          </a>
          <a href="/investor" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-6 text-sm font-semibold text-foreground shadow-sm transition-colors hover:bg-muted focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring">
            Talk to the Investor AI
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bg-muted/30 px-6 py-24 border-y border-border/50">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">
            A New Era of Engagement
          </h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-muted-foreground">
            We're taking the core conversations of Renegade Capital and transforming them into interactive, AI-driven experiences designed to drive traffic, deepen engagement, and bridge the gap between ethical finance and technology.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-8 transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#a96c61]/50 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="mb-6 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#a96c61]/10 text-[#a96c61]">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
                <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Social Justice Investing</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
              Rooted in Andrea Longton's <em>The Social Justice Investor</em>, our new interactive AI helps users build wealth while closing the wealth gap and building an inclusive economy.
            </p>
            <a href="/investor" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-[#a96c61] hover:underline">
              Try the Investor Agent <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-8 transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:border-[#bac48c]/50 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="mb-6 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-[#bac48c]/10 text-[#bac48c]">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path>
                <path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"></path>
                <line x1="12" y1="19" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
                <line x1="8" y1="23" x2="16" y2="23"></line>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">AI-Curated Matchups</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
              A brand new way to explore content. We use AI to generate hypothetical podcast matchups between leading voices in finance, social justice, and AI ethics.
            </p>
            <a href="/episodes" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-[#bac48c] hover:underline">
              View Episodes <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="group relative rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-8 transition-all hover:shadow-lg hover:border-primary/50 overflow-hidden">
            <div class="mb-6 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                <path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Interactive Viewports</h3>
            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">
              Stop just listening. Start participating. Chat directly with the Podcast Curator AI to propose new questions, draft transcripts, and save collaborative notes dynamically.
            </p>
            <a href="/podcast" class="mt-6 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:underline">
              Chat with the Curator <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="relative px-6 py-24 overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-background"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent to-[#a96c61]/5"></div>
      
      <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-4xl">
          Ready to go renegade?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-6 text-base text-muted-foreground sm:text-lg">
          Your money and your voice are powerful tools for social change. Start using them intentionally with our next-generation AI platform.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:justify-center">
          <a href="/investor" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#a96c61] px-8 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow transition-all hover:bg-[#8b574d] hover:scale-105">
            Start Investing
          </a>
          <a href="/guests" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border-2 border-[#bac48c] bg-transparent px-8 text-sm font-bold text-[#bac48c] shadow-sm transition-all hover:bg-[#bac48c]/10 hover:scale-105">
            Meet the Guests
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
